From: Krishnapriya Kunhikannan <kkunhika@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 27 Aug 2025 15:30:05 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Modem-is-not-found-bugfix

---
 .../0010-Modem_is_not_found_bugfix.patch      | 156 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 156 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 net/modemmanager/patches/0010-Modem_is_not_found_bugfix.patch

diff --git a/net/modemmanager/patches/0010-Modem_is_not_found_bugfix.patch b/net/modemmanager/patches/0010-Modem_is_not_found_bugfix.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..132aece
--- /dev/null
+++ b/net/modemmanager/patches/0010-Modem_is_not_found_bugfix.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,156 @@
+This patch file is from Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. and
+is provided under the following license:
